{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t長和發出公告指，未有對任何零售業務獨立上市的交易作出決定，有關策略探索、評估及相關籌備工作仍然持續，目前並不確定是否進行有關交易。<br/>\n<br/>\n長和表示，知悉最近有報道指，集團暫停旗下零售業務建議獨立上市。<br/>\n<br/>\n公告指，集團不時接獲建議，並探索及評估可供考慮的機會，以提升股東長遠價值。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.652680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:55:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:46.128196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:26.967405+00:00","content_hash":"e6cdb71f5a6d35f28fd2069058fa4ccf94bb9c435ebc60a51f032a960a9ad9fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}